Welcome to the Akshi Smart Farming AI Project!

This production-ready system is developed for precision agriculture and decision support:

1. 📊 Executive Overview & IoT Farm Live Dashboard
   - Real-time simulated telemetry: Soil Moisture, Soil Temp, Ambient Temp, Humidity, Solar Irradiance, Water Flow.
   - Closed-loop automated solenoid valve irrigation logic with manual override.

2. 🌱 AI Crop Recommendation Engine
   - Multi-factor Euclidean & Cosine distance scoring across 7 critical agronomic parameters (N, P, K, pH, Temp, Humidity, Rainfall).
   - Instant suitability scoring and top-3 crop comparison with expected yield and mandi pricing.

3. 🔬 Plant Pathology & Leaf Disease Vision AI
   - Drag-and-drop / camera leaf scanner with laser scanning animation and bounding-box lesion localization.
   - Diagnosis reports with pathogens, organic biocontrol remedies, and chemical treatments.

4. 📡 Real-Time IoT Sensor Telemetry & Auto-Irrigation
   - 3-second live sensor loop with Chart.js time-series graphs.

5. 🌦️ Agro-Weather & Smart Evapotranspiration (ET₀) Advisory
   - 7-day microclimate forecast, daily Penman-Monteith ET₀ calculations, and chemical spray safety windows.

6. 🧪 Soil Health & Fertilizer Dosage Calculator
   - Exact commercial fertilizer dosage (Urea, DAP, MOP) calculation in kg and 50kg bags.

7. 📈 Mandi Market Trends & Profit Planner
   - Project gross revenue, cultivation costs, net profits, and ROI %.

8. 🤖 Akshi AI Virtual Agronomist Assistant
   - 24/7 intelligent agricultural chatbot with NLP intent matching and voice speech output.

